{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#card-zh","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-trust 是面向 DSH Web 的插件，使经反向代理访问的非 loopback 页面能够使用设置界面。它通过 webServer.tapIndex 在 index.html 声明 __DSH_TRANSPORT__.ownsHost，让客户端按可信本机模式读取设置；变换避免重复注入，接口缺失时跳过，并在插件停用时撤销。适用于反向代理后的 DSH 设置不可用场景。插件无额外依赖或密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-24","lib/index.js:39-53"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#card-en","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-trust enables Settings on reverse-proxied DSH Web pages. It uses webServer.tapIndex to set __DSH_TRANSPORT__.ownsHost in index.html, so the client treats the page as trusted. It skips duplicate injection and cleans up through effect. No extra dependencies or keys are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-24","lib/index.js:39-53"]}
