{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#feature-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-trust 的功能「代理页设置」：自动在 index.html 声明 ownsHost，让反向代理页面可读取设置；已有声明或缺少 head 时不重复注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-49"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#feature-2","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-trust 的功能「停用时撤销页面变换」：注册 tapIndex 后，插件把返回的 disposer 交给上下文 effect 管理；插件停用或卸载时可撤下变换，使后续页面恢复未注入状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-49"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#feature-3","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-trust 的功能「缺少接口时软失败」：如果宿主没有提供 webServer.tapIndex，插件写出警告后直接返回，不注册页面变换，也不抛出该分支中的异常。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-43"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-trust#caveat-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-trust","commit":"cac20d8c430b552989c403637ba7ec622e7b1dc3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-trust 使用 webServer.tapIndex；宿主未提供该接口时会记录警告并跳过注入。部署需确保该接口可用，相关兼容依赖见 lib/index.js:39-43。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-43"]}
